{
  "comment": [
    "Maps figure ids used in src/data to a page of the report PDF in pdfs/.",
    "Run 'npm run figures' to build public/figures from them.",
    "Run 'npm run figures -- --inspect' to dump every page and every embedded",
    "image of the PDFs; then add \"image\": <n> (embedded image index on that page)",
    "or \"rect\": [x, y, w, h] (fractions of the page, 0..1) to an entry to narrow",
    "it down. Without either, the whole page is exported.",
    "Graph Theory exam figures use a 'gt-' exam prefix (gt-ws2021, gt-ss2021, gt-ws2223,",
    "gt-ss2023, gt-ws2324, gt-ss2024, gt-ss2024b, gt-ws2425, gt-ss2025, gt-mock2025) so they never collide with the Embedded module's ids above."
